OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain possible through
OL,6,FLochaber and Speyside, this clearing
OL,7,Fsouth during the morning. Otherwise
OL,8,Fbright with occasional sunny spells
OL,9,Fand a scattering of showers. Breezy at
OL,10,Ffirst across the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy or partly cloudy
OL,13,Fduring this evening and overnight. The
OL,14,Fshowers well scattered at first,
OL,15,Fbecoming more widespread and heavy
OL,16,Faround the west coast later in the
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
