OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FHeavy showers, these merging
OL,6,Fat times with the risk of the odd
OL,7,Fthunderstorm leading to surface water.
OL,8,FBecoming drier and brighter from the
OL,9,Fwest later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and occasional heavy showers on
OL,13,FFriday. The showers lighter and well
OL,14,Fscattered on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,15,Fmore in the way of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
